The shop's canonical title-slug rule (per `tests/test_text.py` and `categories.py`) is `shopkit.utils.text.slug_for_title`, which produces `creme-brulee-set-6-pcs`-style slugs (hyphens, diacritics folded). The `slugify`/`makeSlug` helpers use different rules (underscores / no diacritic handling), so they don't match the established title convention.

